# Health Data Format Guide

## Data File Formats
All cleaned data files in `Data/someshbgd3/Cleaned/` follow CSV format with standardized timestamps.

### Exercise Sessions
`exerciseSession_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv`:
- start: Timestamp of exercise start
- end: Timestamp of exercise end
- exerciseSession_exerciseType: Type of exercise
- exerciseSession_total_time: Duration in minutes
- exerciseSession_intensity: Exercise intensity score

### Sleep Data
`sleepSession_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv`:
- start: Sleep start timestamp
- end: Sleep end timestamp
- total_sleep_time: Total sleep duration
- sleep_quality: Sleep quality metrics

### Heart Rate
`heartRate_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv`:
- timestamp: Measurement timestamp
- heart_rate: Heart rate value in BPM

### Nutrition
`nutrition_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv`:
- timestamp: Food entry timestamp
- calories: Total calories
- protein: Protein content (g)
- carbohydrates: Carb content (g)
- fat: Fat content (g)

### Weight
`weight_someshbgd3_Cleaned.csv`:
- timestamp: Measurement timestamp
- weight: Weight value in kg
